5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get started! I feel like we should really keep an eye on where our budget actually goes this time. Let's make sure we don't have any scary surprises when the bills arrive!,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Budget is certainly a priority, Mio. However, I believe we must also consider the human cost. We should examine if our current staffing levels can actually support the demands of a major exhibition without causing burnout.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Budget and staffing are basic necessities, but they aren't the goal. If we ignore why people actually visit, we're just managing a void. We need to look at the actual visitor data first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"While those points are valid, we cannot overlook the physical constraints of the gallery. A successful exhibition is impossible if the building itself cannot support the installation. We must prioritize the structural integrity of the space.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see such passion from everyone. While those are all important, I worry about the promises we make to our guests. We must ensure the pieces actually arrive on time and safely.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I totally get that, Shizue! But if we spend too much on shipping or fancy mounts, we might run out of money for the rest of the show. I really want to see where the money disappears!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, financial transparency is useful, but money cannot replace missing personnel. If we are understaffed, even a generous budget won't prevent operational failure. We need to know who is actually available to execute the plan.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, personnel are just tools. The real failure is a gallery that no one wants to enter. If we don't understand the audience's desires, we're just efficiently organizing a failure. Let's prioritize the visitor records.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, audience desire is irrelevant if the floor collapses or the bay fails. We are discussing a physical space, not a theoretical one. We must verify the structural limits before committing to any specific proposal.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, you are quite right to be cautious. However, I often think of the disappointment in a visitor's eyes when a promised masterpiece is missing. Let us look into the logistics to avoid such sadness.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I see your points! But if we don't know the hidden costs, we might pick a ""safe"" show that's actually a money pit. I'm determined to find out where the budget leaks!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, I understand your determination. However, I am equally determined to ensure our team isn't pushed to a breaking point. We must verify the current capacity of our lab and volunteers before we commit to any ambitious project.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your concern for the team is touching, but sentiment doesn't fill a room. I'm more interested in the cold reality of the numbers. Let's see what the visitors actually think and how many actually show up.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, numbers are only useful if they are grounded in reality. I am not interested in sentiment, but in the physical capacity of our facility. We must ensure the building can handle the load.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we all have such different, yet vital, perspectives. To make sure we don't let our guests down, I shall look into the lender paperwork and the transport costs. Let us find a path that is kind to everyone.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,You've all convinced me that we need a full picture! I'll dig into the mount-making charges and the loan transport costs. I'm going to find those hidden budget leaks for us!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog, as well as the composition of the volunteer roster. We must be honest about who is actually available to do the work.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll take the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips. Let's see if the public's actual behavior matches the curators' optimistic projections.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery. We must ensure the building's physical limits are respected and that the space remains functional.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with everyone's choices. To complement your findings, I will look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs. I hope this helps us avoid any disappointments.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
